%% Sara's call flow (prompts/system_v1.md, plan.md §8). Tool names are webhook tools on the backend.
flowchart TD
    start([Greeting: هلا والله، معكم سارة من مقاضينا]) --> intent{What does the caller want?}

    intent -->|price / stock| gp[get_product] --> clar{needs_clarification?}
    clar -->|yes| ask[One question, at most 2 options] --> gp
    clar -->|no| said[Say say_ar; offer to add] --> intent

    intent -->|store facts| si[get_store_info] --> intent
    intent -->|order status| st[check_order_status: order_id OR phone] --> intent
    intent -->|off-topic / not sold| off[One polite line, redirect] --> intent

    intent -->|order| items[Items + qty via get_product] --> name[Name]
    name --> phone[Phone, read back digit by digit] --> ful{Pickup or delivery?}
    ful -->|delivery| area[Area] --> slot[Time slot]
    ful -->|pickup| slot
    slot --> quote[quote_order]
    quote -->|error: below_minimum / area_not_served| fix[Say say_ar, ask what to change] --> items
    quote -->|ok| readback[Read back items, total_spoken_ar, slot: تمام كذا؟]
    readback -->|correction| items
    readback -->|clear yes| create[create_order with quote_id] --> oid[Read order number digit by digit] --> bye([end_call])

    intent -->|asks for staff / angry x2 / not understood x2 / cancel| esc[escalate_to_human] --> cb[Say callback line] --> bye
